WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.589 --> 00:00:07.510
Although it is true that we fall in love,
that does not mean that once we fall, we just

00:00:07.510 --> 00:00:09.790
simply lie there.

00:00:09.790 --> 00:00:16.410
The infatuating sense of love that we feel
when we first fall for someone cannot last

00:00:16.410 --> 00:00:17.950
forever.

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:23.640
This sensation is merely the brain’s way
of attempting to motivate reproduction.

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:28.830
It comes, works to do its job, and then leaves.

00:00:28.830 --> 00:00:33.080
But the relationship formed from it does not
have to.

00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:40.780
If the relationship is honest and worthy,
the true love underneath can live on.

00:00:40.780 --> 00:00:47.510
True love can perpetuate when one understands
that, like everything in life, love goes through

00:00:47.510 --> 00:00:50.760
various stages and conditions.

00:00:50.760 --> 00:00:57.740
It molds to our unique and changing life,
and we must adapt and react accordingly.

00:00:57.740 --> 00:01:06.299
The unconscious and lustful love that we experience
during the honeymoon-phase of relationships

00:01:06.299 --> 00:01:09.520
is often easy and carefree.

00:01:09.520 --> 00:01:15.439
But this phase will eventually fade, and you
must ensure that the individuals that you

00:01:15.439 --> 00:01:22.659
choose to engage in relationships with for
the purpose of love are individuals of whom

00:01:22.659 --> 00:01:29.530
you will still want and enjoy love with when
the roses die.

00:01:29.530 --> 00:01:31.369
True love requires effort.

00:01:31.369 --> 00:01:37.740
And you must work to ensure that such effort
is worthwhile.

00:01:37.740 --> 00:01:41.689
Like everything in life, you get what you
put in.

00:01:41.689 --> 00:01:45.959
And things that are worth a lot, require a
lot.

00:01:45.959 --> 00:01:52.880
By being aware of and embracing the effort
that must come after the initial surge of

00:01:52.880 --> 00:01:59.969
love flees, you can work to facilitate love
beyond just lust and romance.

00:01:59.969 --> 00:02:09.000
You can merge your life with another persons
and experience the wonder of genuine connection.

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:15.590
We must constantly check our pride and ego
within a relationship and prevent any sense

00:02:15.590 --> 00:02:18.760
of comfort, selfishness, or routine within
it.

00:02:18.760 --> 00:02:25.219
You must be mindful and consider what differences
you and your partner have.

00:02:25.219 --> 00:02:30.299
What is it that they like that you do not,
and vice versa?

00:02:30.299 --> 00:02:36.989
We must not let our selfishness prevent us
from providing a balanced and mutual exchange

00:02:36.989 --> 00:02:42.530
of love according to each partners’ needs
and preferences.

00:02:42.530 --> 00:02:48.650
We must constantly make sacrifices and be
willing to give up portions of our life that

00:02:48.650 --> 00:02:55.849
help balance out our partners, trusting that
they will do the same for us.

00:02:55.849 --> 00:03:01.629
As scary as this may be, it is one of the
only risks worth taking in life.

00:03:01.629 --> 00:03:08.359
A life experienced without connection and
love is a life unfulfilled.

00:03:08.359 --> 00:03:11.499
It is an incomplete work of art.

00:03:11.499 --> 00:03:18.159
If we wish to earn the experience of true
love and fulfill the work of art that is our

00:03:18.159 --> 00:03:25.489
life, we must realize the balance between
the unconscious, infatuating acquisition of

00:03:25.489 --> 00:03:42.500
love, and the conscious conservation of it.

